OL,3,GNEWSAFoxes split with sponsor after
OL,4,Aporn actress row
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester City have parted ways with
OL,7,Ftheir main shirt sponsor after the
OL,8,Fgambling firm appointed a porn actress
OL,9,Fas an ambassador.
OL,11,FBC Game - which was named as a sponsor
OL,12,Ffor the League One side at the start of
OL,13,Fthe 2024-25 season - named Eva Elfie as
OL,14,Fa brand ambassador earlier this month.
OL,16,FThe online gambling company posted a
OL,17,Fvideo of Elfie and a delivery driver on
OL,18,Fsocial media, with the caption:
OL,19,F"Welcome to BC Game Eva Elfie! Let the
OL,20,Ffun begin."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
