OL,3,GNEWSAFoxes split with sponsor after
OL,4,Aporn actress row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club, which had faced criticism
OL,7,Ffrom fans' group The Foxes Trust, said
OL,8,Fit had reached a "mutual agreement" to
OL,9,Fend its partnership with the firm, and
OL,10,Fsupporters who had bought shirts in the
OL,11,Fpast 28 days could exchange them.
